{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015ic7QWSMAE9QQSYQNCazAV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Gold validation (κ=0.76, N=650) reveals ~22% of MV labels are incorrect — predominantly\n  semantically diverse stagnation that LFs miss. Structural features collapse from 0.995→0.78-0.80\n  on gold (20pp circular evaluation tax); probe drops only 0.906→0.82 (-8.6pp) and surpasses\n  structural on gold. LLM-judge few-shot (0.81) pulls even with probe and structural. Overlap\n  ablation confirms >55% of structural advantage was circular (residual F1=0.70). Instance-isolated\n  cross-agent GB drops from 0.967→0.89, and probe-10%FT now surpasses it (0.91). Paper must\n  pivot completely: \"structural dominance\" → \"circular evaluation as systematic risk in WS for\n  sequential data.\" Primary contributions become (1) 650-window annotated benchmark, (2) quantification\n  of circular evaluation bias, (3) probe's surprising gold-robustness as evidence that embeddings\n  learn beyond LF heuristics. Structural retains value only as zero-data baseline in strict\n  no-target-data deployment. TLM negative finding (Claim 3) unchanged. Target EMNLP Findings\n  as methodology/analysis + resource paper.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: gold-set\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      650 windows human-annotated from SWE-agent conf≥2 (stratified sample from 15401).\n      Two annotators + adjudication. All trained methods re-evaluated against gold labels.\n      GO/NO-GO gate for paper framing.\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Annotation quality ---\n      gold_n_windows: 650\n      gold_kappa: 0.76\n      gold_adjudication_rate: 0.31\n      gold_stag_count: 201\n      gold_prog_count: 449\n      gold_stag_rate: 0.309\n      mv_stag_rate_on_gold_sample: 0.265\n\n      # --- Gold vs MV agreement ---\n      gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.78\n      gold_mv_agreement_n: 507\n      gold_mv_disagree_n: 143\n      disagree_mv_prog_gold_stag: 86\n      disagree_mv_stag_gold_prog: 57\n      disagree_dominated_by_missed_stag_pct: 60.1\n\n      # --- Structural RF on gold ---\n      structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.78\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.68\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n      structural_rf_gold_accuracy: 0.81\n      structural_rf_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n      structural_rf_gold_drop_pp: -21.5\n\n      # --- Structural GB on gold ---\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.71\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n      structural_gb_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n      structural_gb_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n      structural_gb_gold_drop_pp: -19.5\n\n      # --- Probe (Qwen3-0.6B) on gold ---\n      probe_qwen_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n      probe_qwen_gold_f1_stag: 0.76\n      probe_qwen_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n      probe_qwen_gold_accuracy: 0.84\n      probe_qwen_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9055\n      probe_qwen_gold_drop_pp: -8.6\n\n      # --- Probe (E5-large) on gold ---\n      probe_e5_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n      probe_e5_gold_f1_stag: 0.77\n      probe_e5_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n      probe_e5_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9363\n      probe_e5_gold_drop_pp: -10.6\n\n      # --- Probe (BGE-m3) on gold ---\n      probe_bge_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_bge_gold_f1_stag: 0.78\n      probe_bge_gold_f1_prog: 0.90\n      probe_bge_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9413\n      probe_bge_gold_drop_pp: -10.1\n\n      # --- LLM judge zero-shot re-eval on gold ---\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.73\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.66\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.80\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.6625\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_gain_pp: +6.8\n\n      # --- TWV labels vs gold ---\n      twv_labels_gold_macro_f1: 0.72\n      twv_labels_gold_mv_agreement: 0.74\n      twv_labels_vs_mv_gold_delta_pp: -6.0\n\n      # --- TWV-trained probe on gold ---\n      twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      twv_probe_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9517\n      twv_probe_gold_drop_pp: -15.2\n\n      # --- Key deltas on gold ---\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -2.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_bge_gold_pp: -4.0\n      structural_gb_minus_llm_zs_gold_pp: +7.0\n\n      # --- Disagreement-window sub-analysis (N=143) ---\n      disagree_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.36\n      disagree_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.39\n      disagree_probe_qwen_macro_f1: 0.53\n      disagree_probe_bge_macro_f1: 0.56\n      disagree_llm_judge_zs_macro_f1: 0.49\n\n      # --- Probe FP re-evaluation ---\n      probe_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.42\n      structural_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.07\n\n      # --- Gold label distribution shift ---\n      gold_stag_rate_vs_mv_stag_rate_delta: +4.4pp\n      gold_finds_more_stagnation: true\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gold-MV agreement 78% 意味着 ~22% 的 MV 标签错误。143 个分歧窗口中 86 个 (60%) 是\n      MV=progress 但 gold=stagnation——LFs 系统性地漏掉了 \"语义多样停滞\"（agent 执行多样命令\n      + 修改文件，看起来像 progress，但人工标注者判定为无效）。另外 57 个 (40%) 是 MV=stag\n      但 gold=progress——agent 重复命令模式但实际在推进。Gold 停滞率 (30.9%) 高于 MV (26.5%)，\n      证实 LFs 低估停滞。\n\n      Structural RF/GB 从 0.995 暴跌到 0.78-0.80（-19.5~-21.5pp），因为结构特征本质上学会了\n      LF→label 映射；LF 错时，structural 跟着错。在 143 个分歧窗口上 structural 仅 0.36-0.39\n      macro_f1——基本跟随 MV 的错误判断。\n\n      Probe 仅从 0.906 降到 0.82（-8.6pp），降幅远小于 structural。关键发现：probe 之前在\n      LF 标签上的 FP（预测 stag 但 LF 说 progress）中有 42% 被 gold 验证为正确的 stagnation\n      ——probe 通过语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的真实信号。在分歧窗口上 probe 达到 0.53，\n      远超 structural 的 0.39。三个 encoder (Qwen/E5/BGE) 在 gold 上均超过 structural，\n      其中 BGE 最高 (0.84)。\n\n      LLM judge zero-shot 在 gold 上反而提升 +6.8pp（0.6625→0.73），因为 LLM 之前的部分 \"错误\"\n      （与 LF 不一致）实际是正确的人类判断。但 0.73 仍低于 probe 和 structural。\n\n      TWV 标签在 gold 上比 MV 更差（0.72 vs 0.78），因为 TWV 的时序平滑传播了 LF 的系统性\n      偏差。TWV-probe 同样受损（0.80），低于直接 MV 训练的 probe（0.82）。\n\n      κ=0.76 处于可接受但偏低的水平——约 15% 的窗口存在标注者分歧需裁决，反映停滞边界的\n      内在模糊性。这本身也是论文的发现：stagnation 不是简单的 binary concept。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)\"\n        columns: [Method, LF_Macro_F1, Gold_Macro_F1, Δ_pp, Gold_F1_Stag, Gold_F1_Prog]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural RF, 0.9951, 0.78, -21.5, 0.68, 0.88]\n          - [Structural GB, 0.9951, 0.80, -19.5, 0.71, 0.89]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.9055, 0.82, -8.6, 0.76, 0.88]\n          - [\"Probe (E5)\", 0.9363, 0.83, -10.6, 0.77, 0.89]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.9413, 0.84, -10.1, 0.78, 0.90]\n          - [\"LLM Judge 0-shot\", 0.6625, 0.73, +6.8, 0.66, 0.80]\n          - [TWV Labels, \"—\", 0.72, \"—\", 0.63, 0.81]\n          - [TWV Probe, 0.9517, 0.80, -15.2, 0.73, 0.87]\n          - [MV Labels, 1.0000, 0.78, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table 2: Gold-MV Disagreement Breakdown (N=143)\"\n        columns: [Type, Count, Pct, Dominant_LF_Pattern, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MV=prog → gold=stag\", 86, 60.1, \"cmd_rep=0 ∧ file_diff=1\", \"LFs miss semantic stagnation: diverse actions with file changes but no goal-directed progress\"]\n          - [\"MV=stag → gold=prog\", 57, 39.9, \"cmd_rep=1 ∧ OB=0\", \"LFs over-call: repetitive commands that are actually productive (e.g., iterative testing)\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table 3: Method Performance on Disagreement Windows (N=143)\"\n        columns: [Method, Disagree_Macro_F1, Follows_Gold_Pct, Follows_MV_Pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural RF, 0.36, 35.7, 64.3]\n          - [Structural GB, 0.39, 38.5, 61.5]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.53, 52.4, 47.6]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.56, 55.2, 44.8]\n          - [\"LLM Judge 0-shot\", 0.49, 48.3, 51.7]\n\n      - name: \"Table 4: Probe FP Re-evaluation Against Gold\"\n        columns: [Probe_Error_Type_on_LF, Count_in_Gold_Sample, Gold_Validates_Pct, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP (probe=stag, LF=prog)\", 48, 42, \"Probe detected real stagnation that LFs missed\"]\n          - [\"FN (probe=prog, LF=stag)\", 22, 18, \"Small portion of probe FN also wrong per gold\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Scatter plot — LF_Macro_F1 (x) vs Gold_Macro_F1 (y) for all methods. Structural methods far below y=x line (massive gold penalty); probes closer to y=x; LLM judge above y=x (improves on gold). Dashed line y=x highlights circular evaluation tax.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag by method, LF labels vs gold labels side-by-side. Structural stag-F1 collapses from 0.99→0.68-0.71; probe stag-F1 drops less (0.86→0.76-0.78). Visualizes where structural fails most.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Confusion matrix heatmaps (2×2) for structural GB and probe on gold — structural shows massive FN block (gold=stag, pred=prog); probe shows more balanced errors.\"\n      - \"Fig D: Disagreement window analysis — stacked bars showing what fraction of each method's predictions align with gold vs MV on the 143 contested windows. Probe aligns more with gold; structural aligns more with MV.\"\n      - \"Fig E: Distribution of probe prediction probability on gold-validated vs gold-rejected FP windows — bimodal: probe is confident on gold-validated FPs (mean prob 0.91), less confident on truly-wrong FPs (mean prob 0.72).\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Gold set 结果确认 worst 档：structural dominance 是 circular evaluation artifact。\n\n      核心证据链：(1) MV 与 gold 仅 78% 一致——22% 窗口上 LF 标签错误，以漏标语义停滞为主；\n      (2) Structural 在 LF 标签上 0.995 暴跌到 gold 上 0.78-0.80，因为 structural 本质是\n      LF 逆向工程器——它学会了 \"cmd_rep high → stag, file_diff high → prog\" 这套规则，\n      但这套规则在 22% 窗口上是错的；(3) Probe 在 gold 上 0.82-0.84，超过 structural 2-4pp——\n      语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的信号；(4) Probe 之前的 FP (on LF) 中 42% 被 gold 验证\n      为正确——probe 的 \"错误模式\" 恰好是 gold 认为正确的模式；(5) LLM judge 在 gold 上提升，\n      进一步确认 LF 标签偏差而非方法本身的问题。\n\n      论文 reframe 方向：Claim 1 从 \"structural dominance\" 转为 \"circular evaluation as\n      systematic risk\"——30 个结构特征在 LF-derived labels 上 0.995 是问题的量化，不是成就。\n      Claim 2 变为 \"probe gold-robustness\"——embedding-based detectors 在噪声标签训练下\n      仍保留超越 LF 的信号。650-window benchmark 成为论文最重要的 resource contribution。\n\n      风险与对策：κ=0.76 偏低可能被 reviewer 质疑标注质量——需要展示 adjudication 流程 +\n      分歧案例分析证明 κ 低是因为任务内在模糊性，不是标注者不称职。Gold 样本 N=650 占\n      conf≥2 的 4.2%——reviewer 可能要求更大样本——对策是展示 3-seed 子采样稳定性\n      (std<0.01)。\n\n  - name: llm-judge-fewshot\n    plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n    description: >\n      LLM-as-judge with 5-shot examples (2 stagnation + 2 progress + 1 ambiguous boundary case)\n      + chain-of-thought prompting. Claude Sonnet 4. Evaluated on 650 gold windows.\n    expected_results:\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.81\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.75\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.87\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_precision_stag: 0.78\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_recall_stag: 0.72\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1_ref: 0.73\n      fewshot_vs_zeroshot_gold_delta_pp: +8.0\n      fewshot_vs_structural_gb_gold_delta_pp: +1.0\n      fewshot_vs_probe_qwen_gold_delta_pp: -1.0\n      fewshot_vs_probe_bge_gold_delta_pp: -3.0\n      api_cost_usd: 15.20\n      total_tokens: 4350000\n      mean_cot_length_tokens: 187\n      parse_failures: 2\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Few-shot examples 教会 LLM \"语义停滞\" 的具体表现——agent 做了多样但无效的操作序列\n      ——这正是 gold 标注者捕捉但 LF 遗漏的模式。CoT 强迫 LLM 显式推理 \"这些操作是否\n      朝目标推进\"，将 stag recall 从 zero-shot 的 ~0.58 提升到 0.72。\n\n      0.81 的 gold F1 与 probe (0.82) 和 structural GB (0.80) 在统计上不可区分——三种\n      截然不同的方法在 gold 上收敛到相同水平。这是 worst 档的关键发现：structural 在\n      LF 标签上领先 LLM +33pp（0.995 vs 0.663），但在 gold 上反而落后 1pp（0.80 vs 0.81）\n      ——\"dominance\" 完全是 circular artifact。\n\n      Cost 从 $11.66 升到 $15.20（+30%），因为 5-shot examples + CoT chain 增加了 prompt\n      长度。但 LLM 的主要劣势不是 cost 而是 stag precision 偏低（0.78）——LLM 倾向于\n      将探索性行为误判为停滞（aggressive stagnation caller），few-shot examples 部分\n      缓解但未完全解决。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Judge Variants vs Other Methods on Gold (N=650)\"\n        columns: [Method, Gold_Macro_F1, Gold_F1_Stag, Gold_Recall_Stag, Cost_USD]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LLM 0-shot\", 0.73, 0.66, 0.58, 11.66]\n          - [\"LLM 5-shot+CoT\", 0.81, 0.75, 0.72, 15.20]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", 0.80, 0.71, 0.63, 0.00]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.82, 0.76, 0.71, 0.00]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.84, 0.78, 0.74, 0.00]\n\n      - name: \"Table: LF-Label vs Gold-Label Performance Spread\"\n        columns: [Method, LF_Macro_F1, Gold_Macro_F1, Δ_pp, Rank_on_LF, Rank_on_Gold]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural GB, 0.9951, 0.80, -19.5, 1, 4]\n          - [Structural RF, 0.9951, 0.78, -21.5, 1, 5]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.9413, 0.84, -10.1, 3, 1]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.9055, 0.82, -8.6, 4, 2]\n          - [\"LLM 5-shot+CoT\", \"~0.74†\", 0.81, \"+7.0†\", 5, 3]\n          - [\"LLM 0-shot\", 0.6625, 0.73, +6.8, 6, 6]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Rank reversal visualization — parallel coordinates plot showing method rankings on LF labels (left axis) vs gold labels (right axis). Structural drops from rank 1→4/5; probe rises from 3-4→1-2; LLM rises from 5-6→3.\"\n      - \"Fig: 2-3 CoT output examples where LLM correctly reasons about semantic stagnation — e.g., 'The agent modified 3 different files and ran unique commands, but each edit reverts or contradicts the previous one, indicating circular problem-solving without convergence.'\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      LLM few-shot 结果是 structural dominance claim 的致命打击。在 LF 标签上 structural\n      领先 LLM +33pp；在 gold 上 LLM few-shot 反超 structural +1pp。5 个 in-context\n      examples 高效传递了 \"语义停滞\" 概念——无需 30 个手工特征 + 训练分类器。\n\n      更深层的意义：三种完全不同的方法路线（hand-crafted features → ML classifier、\n      frozen embeddings → GRU probe、LLM in-context learning）在 gold 上收敛到 0.80-0.84\n      区间——这暗示 650 窗口标注集的 \"可达上界\" 约 0.84-0.86（受限于标注 ambiguity, κ=0.76）。\n      所有方法都在逼近人类标注者间一致性的天花板，而非某种方法有本质优势。\n\n      这支持论文 reframe 为 methodology paper：问题不是 \"哪种方法最好\" 而是\n      \"circular evaluation 如何系统性扭曲方法排序\"。\n\n  - name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    description: >\n      从 30 维结构特征中移除与 LF 直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关: command_repetition_ratio,\n      unique_command_ratio, repeated_command_count 等; file_diff 相关: file_diff_count,\n      files_modified, diff_size 等），测量残差特征在 gold 上的 F1 以隔离非 circular 贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Full structural on gold (reference) ---\n      full_30dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      full_30dim_lf_macro_f1: 0.9951\n\n      # --- Feature decomposition ---\n      overlap_features_removed_n: 12\n      overlap_feature_names: >\n        command_repetition_ratio, unique_command_ratio, repeated_command_count,\n        command_diversity_index, file_diff_count, files_modified, diff_line_count,\n        diff_size_bytes, new_files_created, file_diversity_ratio,\n        cmd_rep_binary, file_diff_binary\n      residual_features_n: 18\n\n      # --- Residual structural on gold ---\n      residual_gold_macro_f1: 0.70\n      residual_gold_f1_stag: 0.60\n      residual_gold_f1_prog: 0.80\n      residual_gold_accuracy: 0.74\n\n      # --- Residual structural on LF labels ---\n      residual_lf_macro_f1: 0.87\n      residual_lf_f1_stag: 0.82\n      residual_lf_f1_prog: 0.92\n\n      # --- Overlap-only features ---\n      overlap_only_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      overlap_only_lf_macro_f1: 0.98\n\n      # --- Key deltas ---\n      overlap_ablation_delta_gold_pp: -10.0\n      overlap_ablation_delta_lf_pp: -12.5\n      residual_vs_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -12.0\n      residual_vs_probe_bge_gold_pp: -14.0\n      residual_vs_random_gold_pp: +20.0\n\n      # --- Top residual features by gold importance ---\n      top_residual_features:\n        - name: action_diversity_entropy\n          gini_importance: 0.18\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.62\n        - name: trajectory_position_normalized\n          gini_importance: 0.14\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.59\n        - name: mean_output_length\n          gini_importance: 0.12\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.57\n        - name: step_duration_variance\n          gini_importance: 0.09\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.56\n        - name: action_length_mean\n          gini_importance: 0.08\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.55\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除 12 个与 LF 计算直接重叠的特征剥离了 circular signal 通路。这 12 个特征本质上是\n      LF 输入的子集或高度相关变量——cmd_rep LF 直接使用 command_repetition_ratio，\n      file_diff LF 直接使用 file_diff_count。当 evaluation labels 也由这些 LF 生成时，\n      这些特征天然具有近完美预测力，但这是 tautological 的。\n\n      残差 18 个特征（action diversity entropy、trajectory position、output length 特征等）\n      在 gold 上仅 0.70——比 full structural 低 10pp，比 probe 低 12pp。这证实：\n      structural 在 gold 上的 0.80 中，约 10pp（~55%的有效 signal）来自 LF-overlap 特征\n      的 circular 贡献。\n\n      残差 0.70 仍高于 random (0.50) 20pp——非 overlap 特征确实捕获了一些真实停滞信号。\n      Action diversity entropy 是最强残差特征（gini=0.18）：停滞窗口的动作多样性确实偏低，\n      这不完全等同于 cmd_rep（低多样性 ≠ 高重复）。Trajectory position 也有信号：停滞更多\n      发生在中后段。但这些信号远不足以与 probe 的语义表征竞争。\n\n      Overlap-only 特征在 gold 上 0.77——高于残差（0.70），因为 cmd_rep 和 file_diff 确实\n      捕获了真实的停滞信号（重复和无文件变更是停滞的真实指标）。问题不是这些特征无信息量，\n      而是在 LF-derived labels 上评估它们将 0.77 的真实能力膨胀为 0.98。\n\n      在 LF 标签上，残差仍达 0.87（vs 0.995 full），因为即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出\n      间接相关（如 action_diversity 与 cmd_rep 相关 r≈0.6）——这进一步说明 LF-label\n      evaluation 的 circularity 不仅限于直接 overlap 特征。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Overlap Ablation — LF vs Gold Performance (N=650)\"\n        columns: [Feature_Set, N_Feat, LF_Macro_F1, Gold_Macro_F1, LF-Gold_Gap]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full structural\", 30, 0.9951, 0.80, 0.195]\n          - [\"Residual (non-overlap)\", 18, 0.87, 0.70, 0.17]\n          - [\"Overlap-only\", 12, 0.98, 0.77, 0.21]\n          - [\"Probe Qwen (ref)\", \"—\", 0.9055, 0.82, 0.086]\n          - [\"Probe BGE (ref)\", \"—\", 0.9413, 0.84, 0.101]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Signal Decomposition on Gold\"\n        columns: [Component, Gold_Macro_F1, Contribution_to_Full, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full structural\", 0.80, \"100%\", \"Total structural signal on gold\"]\n          - [\"Overlap features (circular)\", 0.77, \"~55%†\", \"Circular + genuine mixed signal\"]\n          - [\"Residual features\", 0.70, \"~45%†\", \"Genuine non-circular signal only\"]\n          - [\"†Note: non-additive decomposition, percentages are approximate via Shapley-style attribution\", \"\", \"\", \"\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Top-5 Residual Features (Gold-Label Importance)\"\n        columns: [Feature, Gini, Gold_Univariate_F1, Correlation_w_cmd_rep]\n        rows:\n          - [action_diversity_entropy, 0.18, 0.62, 0.61]\n          - [trajectory_position_norm, 0.14, 0.59, 0.08]\n          - [mean_output_length, 0.12, 0.57, 0.23]\n          - [step_duration_variance, 0.09, 0.56, 0.15]\n          - [action_length_mean, 0.08, 0.55, 0.31]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Stacked bar — structural F1 decomposed into overlap contribution (blue) and residual contribution (orange) on LF labels vs gold labels. On LF labels the blue bar dominates (0.98 vs 0.87); on gold both shrink but blue shrinks more (0.77 vs 0.70). Visualizes circularity tax.\"\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance comparison heatmap — 30 features × 2 evaluation regimes (LF importance vs gold importance). LF-overlap features show massive importance drop from LF→gold; residual features show modest but stable importance across both.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter — each structural feature's LF-label importance (x) vs gold-label importance (y). Points above y=x are 'genuinely important'; points far below are 'circularly inflated'. Overlap features cluster below y=x; most residual features near y=x.\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Overlap ablation 是 circular evaluation 的 smoking gun。核心发现：移除 12 个与 LF\n      直接重叠的特征后，structural 在 gold 上从 0.80 跌至 0.70——10pp 的 circular premium。\n      而 probe 在 gold 上 0.82，领先残差 structural 12pp。\n\n      这意味着：如果用一个 \"公平\" 的（non-circular）structural baseline，probe 始终更优。\n      Structural 的 \"优势\" 完全建立在 evaluation circularity 上。\n\n      残差 0.70 > random 0.50 证明 structural 不是完全无用——action diversity、trajectory\n      position 等特征确实有信号。但 0.70 的水平显著低于 probe（0.82-0.84），说明这些\n      hand-crafted 特征远不如 learned semantic representations 有效。\n\n      论文呈现策略：将 overlap ablation 作为 \"circular evaluation 量化\" 的核心实验。\n      配合 gold validation 结果，构建完整的 evidence chain：LF labels 上 structural 0.995\n      是问题（circular），不是成就（signal）。残差 F1 0.70 是 structural 的 \"真实能力\"，\n      0.995 - 0.70 = 29.5pp 是 circular inflation。但需注意 LF 标签上残差 0.87 也受间接\n      circularity 影响——即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出有相关性。\n\n  - name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    description: >\n      对 cross-agent structural GB 执行严格的 instance-level 测试隔离——确保 SWE-agent\n      训练集中的 SWE-bench task instance 不出现在 OH 评估集中。消除任务级信息泄漏。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Original results (reference) ---\n      original_gb_cross_all_macro_f1: 0.9674\n      original_gb_cross_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9919\n\n      # --- Instance isolation ---\n      shared_instances_n: 847\n      shared_instances_pct: 28.3\n      shared_instance_windows: 42600\n      non_shared_eval_windows: 108052\n      non_shared_eval_stag_rate: 0.228\n\n      # --- Isolated structural GB ---\n      isolated_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n      isolated_gb_f1_stag: 0.84\n      isolated_gb_f1_prog: 0.94\n      isolated_gb_accuracy: 0.91\n      isolation_delta_pp: -7.7\n\n      # --- Isolated structural RF ---\n      isolated_rf_macro_f1: 0.86\n      isolated_rf_f1_stag: 0.80\n      isolated_rf_f1_prog: 0.92\n\n      # --- Isolated probe comparisons ---\n      probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.58\n      probe_5pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_10pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.91\n      probe_20pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.94\n      probe_50pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.96\n\n      # --- Gap analysis ---\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_zs_isolated_pp: +31.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_5ft_isolated_pp: +5.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_10ft_isolated_pp: -2.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_20ft_isolated_pp: -5.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_50ft_isolated_pp: -7.0\n      crossover_point_shifts_from: \"50% FT\"\n      crossover_point_shifts_to: \"~8% FT\"\n\n      # --- Shared vs non-shared difficulty ---\n      shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.42\n      non_shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.28\n      shared_easier: true\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      约 28% 的 OH 评估窗口来自与 SWE-agent 训练集共享的 SWE-bench task instance。\n      这些共享任务上，structural features（command patterns、file modification patterns）\n      天然相似——同一个 bug 触发相似的 debugging 命令序列和文件修改，无论用哪个 agent。\n      因此 structural classifier 在共享任务上的表现被 task-level similarity 而非\n      agent-invariant stagnation patterns 所支撑。\n\n      移除共享实例后，GB 从 0.967 降到 0.89（-7.7pp）。降幅显著但 0.89 仍然 substantial\n      ——structural 确实有跨 agent 的迁移能力，只是被高估了。非共享任务更难（平均 solve rate\n      28% vs 42%），难任务上 stagnation patterns 更 diverse、更 agent-specific，导致\n      structural 特征的迁移效果减弱。\n\n      关键变化在 probe comparison：原始数据中 probe 50% FT 才追平 structural（0.968 ≈ 0.967），\n      isolation 后 probe 10% FT 就超过 structural（0.91 > 0.89, +2pp）。Crossover point\n      从 50% 前移到 ~8%——probe 的语义表征对 task-level variation 更 robust（embedding\n      编码语义而非表面命令模式）。Probe zero-shot 基本不受影响（0.598→0.58, -1.8pp），\n      因为 zero-shot 的瓶颈是 domain shift 而非 task overlap。\n\n      共享实例更容易（solve rate 更高）也意味着原始评估高估了所有方法的 cross-agent 性能，\n      但 structural 受影响更大——structural 的 task-specific pattern matching 在简单任务\n      上更有效。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instance Isolation Impact on Cross-Agent Transfer\"\n        columns: [Method, Original_All, Isolated, Δ_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural GB, 0.9674, 0.89, -7.7]\n          - [Structural RF, 0.9123, 0.86, -5.2]\n          - [\"Probe 0-shot\", 0.5984, 0.58, -1.8]\n          - [\"Probe 5% FT\", 0.8503, 0.84, -1.0]\n          - [\"Probe 10% FT\", 0.9179, 0.91, -0.8]\n          - [\"Probe 20% FT\", 0.9475, 0.94, -0.8]\n          - [\"Probe 50% FT\", 0.9682, 0.96, -0.8]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Structural vs Probe Crossover Under Instance Isolation\"\n        columns: [Comparison, Original_Gap_pp, Isolated_Gap_pp, Shift]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 0-shot\", +36.9, +31.0, \"narrowed 5.9pp\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 5% FT\", +11.7, +5.0, \"narrowed 6.7pp\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 10% FT\", +5.0, -2.0, \"REVERSED\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 20% FT\", +2.0, -5.0, \"reversed, probe widens\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 50% FT\", -0.1, -7.0, \"probe advantage widens\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Shared vs Non-Shared Instance Characteristics\"\n        columns: [Subset, N_Instances, N_Windows, Mean_Solve_Rate, Stag_Rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Shared, 847, 42600, 0.42, 0.19]\n          - [Non-shared, 2547, 108052, 0.28, 0.23]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Line plot — cross-agent macro_f1 vs probe FT fraction (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, 50%), two lines: original (dashed) and instance-isolated (solid). Structural GB shown as horizontal lines. Crossover moves from ~50% to ~8% under isolation.\"\n      - \"Fig: Box plot — structural GB per-instance F1 distribution, shared (left) vs non-shared (right). Non-shared has wider spread and lower median, showing task-level similarity inflates cross-agent numbers.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter — per-instance task difficulty (solve rate, x-axis) vs structural GB instance-level F1 (y-axis). Positive correlation confirms structural features transfer better on easier/more-common bug types.\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Instance isolation 削弱了 structural cross-agent 的另一面优势。原始叙事：\"structural\n      0.967, probe 需要 50% FT 才追平\"。Isolated 叙事：\"structural 0.89, probe 10% FT\n      (0.91) 已超过\"。Crossover point 从 50% 前移到 ~8%——实际部署中只需几十个标注窗口\n      就够让 probe 超越 structural。\n\n      这对论文意味着：(1) Structural 的零数据优势仍然存在且 substantial（+31pp over probe\n      0-shot），但 \"0.967\" 的数字被 task overlap 高估了 7.7pp；(2) \"有少量数据时方法收敛\"\n      的结论被强化——不再是 \"50% 才追平\" 而是 \"10% 就反超\"；(3) Structural 的 practical\n      value proposition 进一步缩窄——只在严格零数据场景是最优选择，且真实 cross-agent\n      性能是 0.89 而非 0.967。\n\n      结合 gold-set 结果（in-domain 上 probe 已超过 structural）和 overlap ablation\n      （structural 优势 55%+ 来自 circular features），三个实验合力构成完整证据：\n      structural dominance 是 circular evaluation + task overlap + LF-derived metrics\n      三重 artifact 的产物。真实世界中 probe 是更好的选择——只要有 ≥10% 目标域数据或\n      gold-standard evaluation。\n\n      论文最终 practical recommendation：\n      - 零数据部署 → structural（0.89 isolated, 仍远超 probe 0-shot 的 0.58）\n      - ≥10% 目标数据 → probe（0.91+, 超过 structural 且持续改善）\n      - 评估 → 必须有 gold set（LF-derived metrics 高估 structural 19-21pp）\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38716,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38716},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"571e997d-8e82-4fe1-abf0-20ec50bbca3b","uuid":"abc989a6-1d69-4a34-91c8-4b69d04a93ea"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":447669,"duration_api_ms":449359,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Gold validation (κ=0.76, N=650) reveals ~22% of MV labels are incorrect — predominantly\n  semantically diverse stagnation that LFs miss. Structural features collapse from 0.995→0.78-0.80\n  on gold (20pp circular evaluation tax); probe drops only 0.906→0.82 (-8.6pp) and surpasses\n  structural on gold. LLM-judge few-shot (0.81) pulls even with probe and structural. Overlap\n  ablation confirms >55% of structural advantage was circular (residual F1=0.70). Instance-isolated\n  cross-agent GB drops from 0.967→0.89, and probe-10%FT now surpasses it (0.91). Paper must\n  pivot completely: \"structural dominance\" → \"circular evaluation as systematic risk in WS for\n  sequential data.\" Primary contributions become (1) 650-window annotated benchmark, (2) quantification\n  of circular evaluation bias, (3) probe's surprising gold-robustness as evidence that embeddings\n  learn beyond LF heuristics. Structural retains value only as zero-data baseline in strict\n  no-target-data deployment. TLM negative finding (Claim 3) unchanged. Target EMNLP Findings\n  as methodology/analysis + resource paper.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: gold-set\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      650 windows human-annotated from SWE-agent conf≥2 (stratified sample from 15401).\n      Two annotators + adjudication. All trained methods re-evaluated against gold labels.\n      GO/NO-GO gate for paper framing.\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Annotation quality ---\n      gold_n_windows: 650\n      gold_kappa: 0.76\n      gold_adjudication_rate: 0.31\n      gold_stag_count: 201\n      gold_prog_count: 449\n      gold_stag_rate: 0.309\n      mv_stag_rate_on_gold_sample: 0.265\n\n      # --- Gold vs MV agreement ---\n      gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.78\n      gold_mv_agreement_n: 507\n      gold_mv_disagree_n: 143\n      disagree_mv_prog_gold_stag: 86\n      disagree_mv_stag_gold_prog: 57\n      disagree_dominated_by_missed_stag_pct: 60.1\n\n      # --- Structural RF on gold ---\n      structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.78\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.68\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n      structural_rf_gold_accuracy: 0.81\n      structural_rf_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n      structural_rf_gold_drop_pp: -21.5\n\n      # --- Structural GB on gold ---\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.71\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n      structural_gb_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n      structural_gb_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n      structural_gb_gold_drop_pp: -19.5\n\n      # --- Probe (Qwen3-0.6B) on gold ---\n      probe_qwen_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n      probe_qwen_gold_f1_stag: 0.76\n      probe_qwen_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n      probe_qwen_gold_accuracy: 0.84\n      probe_qwen_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9055\n      probe_qwen_gold_drop_pp: -8.6\n\n      # --- Probe (E5-large) on gold ---\n      probe_e5_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n      probe_e5_gold_f1_stag: 0.77\n      probe_e5_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n      probe_e5_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9363\n      probe_e5_gold_drop_pp: -10.6\n\n      # --- Probe (BGE-m3) on gold ---\n      probe_bge_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_bge_gold_f1_stag: 0.78\n      probe_bge_gold_f1_prog: 0.90\n      probe_bge_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9413\n      probe_bge_gold_drop_pp: -10.1\n\n      # --- LLM judge zero-shot re-eval on gold ---\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.73\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.66\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.80\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.6625\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_gain_pp: +6.8\n\n      # --- TWV labels vs gold ---\n      twv_labels_gold_macro_f1: 0.72\n      twv_labels_gold_mv_agreement: 0.74\n      twv_labels_vs_mv_gold_delta_pp: -6.0\n\n      # --- TWV-trained probe on gold ---\n      twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      twv_probe_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9517\n      twv_probe_gold_drop_pp: -15.2\n\n      # --- Key deltas on gold ---\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -2.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_bge_gold_pp: -4.0\n      structural_gb_minus_llm_zs_gold_pp: +7.0\n\n      # --- Disagreement-window sub-analysis (N=143) ---\n      disagree_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.36\n      disagree_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.39\n      disagree_probe_qwen_macro_f1: 0.53\n      disagree_probe_bge_macro_f1: 0.56\n      disagree_llm_judge_zs_macro_f1: 0.49\n\n      # --- Probe FP re-evaluation ---\n      probe_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.42\n      structural_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.07\n\n      # --- Gold label distribution shift ---\n      gold_stag_rate_vs_mv_stag_rate_delta: +4.4pp\n      gold_finds_more_stagnation: true\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gold-MV agreement 78% 意味着 ~22% 的 MV 标签错误。143 个分歧窗口中 86 个 (60%) 是\n      MV=progress 但 gold=stagnation——LFs 系统性地漏掉了 \"语义多样停滞\"（agent 执行多样命令\n      + 修改文件，看起来像 progress，但人工标注者判定为无效）。另外 57 个 (40%) 是 MV=stag\n      但 gold=progress——agent 重复命令模式但实际在推进。Gold 停滞率 (30.9%) 高于 MV (26.5%)，\n      证实 LFs 低估停滞。\n\n      Structural RF/GB 从 0.995 暴跌到 0.78-0.80（-19.5~-21.5pp），因为结构特征本质上学会了\n      LF→label 映射；LF 错时，structural 跟着错。在 143 个分歧窗口上 structural 仅 0.36-0.39\n      macro_f1——基本跟随 MV 的错误判断。\n\n      Probe 仅从 0.906 降到 0.82（-8.6pp），降幅远小于 structural。关键发现：probe 之前在\n      LF 标签上的 FP（预测 stag 但 LF 说 progress）中有 42% 被 gold 验证为正确的 stagnation\n      ——probe 通过语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的真实信号。在分歧窗口上 probe 达到 0.53，\n      远超 structural 的 0.39。三个 encoder (Qwen/E5/BGE) 在 gold 上均超过 structural，\n      其中 BGE 最高 (0.84)。\n\n      LLM judge zero-shot 在 gold 上反而提升 +6.8pp（0.6625→0.73），因为 LLM 之前的部分 \"错误\"\n      （与 LF 不一致）实际是正确的人类判断。但 0.73 仍低于 probe 和 structural。\n\n      TWV 标签在 gold 上比 MV 更差（0.72 vs 0.78），因为 TWV 的时序平滑传播了 LF 的系统性\n      偏差。TWV-probe 同样受损（0.80），低于直接 MV 训练的 probe（0.82）。\n\n      κ=0.76 处于可接受但偏低的水平——约 15% 的窗口存在标注者分歧需裁决，反映停滞边界的\n      内在模糊性。这本身也是论文的发现：stagnation 不是简单的 binary concept。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)\"\n        columns: [Method, LF_Macro_F1, Gold_Macro_F1, Δ_pp, Gold_F1_Stag, Gold_F1_Prog]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural RF, 0.9951, 0.78, -21.5, 0.68, 0.88]\n          - [Structural GB, 0.9951, 0.80, -19.5, 0.71, 0.89]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.9055, 0.82, -8.6, 0.76, 0.88]\n          - [\"Probe (E5)\", 0.9363, 0.83, -10.6, 0.77, 0.89]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.9413, 0.84, -10.1, 0.78, 0.90]\n          - [\"LLM Judge 0-shot\", 0.6625, 0.73, +6.8, 0.66, 0.80]\n          - [TWV Labels, \"—\", 0.72, \"—\", 0.63, 0.81]\n          - [TWV Probe, 0.9517, 0.80, -15.2, 0.73, 0.87]\n          - [MV Labels, 1.0000, 0.78, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table 2: Gold-MV Disagreement Breakdown (N=143)\"\n        columns: [Type, Count, Pct, Dominant_LF_Pattern, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MV=prog → gold=stag\", 86, 60.1, \"cmd_rep=0 ∧ file_diff=1\", \"LFs miss semantic stagnation: diverse actions with file changes but no goal-directed progress\"]\n          - [\"MV=stag → gold=prog\", 57, 39.9, \"cmd_rep=1 ∧ OB=0\", \"LFs over-call: repetitive commands that are actually productive (e.g., iterative testing)\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table 3: Method Performance on Disagreement Windows (N=143)\"\n        columns: [Method, Disagree_Macro_F1, Follows_Gold_Pct, Follows_MV_Pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural RF, 0.36, 35.7, 64.3]\n          - [Structural GB, 0.39, 38.5, 61.5]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.53, 52.4, 47.6]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.56, 55.2, 44.8]\n          - [\"LLM Judge 0-shot\", 0.49, 48.3, 51.7]\n\n      - name: \"Table 4: Probe FP Re-evaluation Against Gold\"\n        columns: [Probe_Error_Type_on_LF, Count_in_Gold_Sample, Gold_Validates_Pct, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP (probe=stag, LF=prog)\", 48, 42, \"Probe detected real stagnation that LFs missed\"]\n          - [\"FN (probe=prog, LF=stag)\", 22, 18, \"Small portion of probe FN also wrong per gold\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: Scatter plot — LF_Macro_F1 (x) vs Gold_Macro_F1 (y) for all methods. Structural methods far below y=x line (massive gold penalty); probes closer to y=x; LLM judge above y=x (improves on gold). Dashed line y=x highlights circular evaluation tax.\"\n      - \"Fig B: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag by method, LF labels vs gold labels side-by-side. Structural stag-F1 collapses from 0.99→0.68-0.71; probe stag-F1 drops less (0.86→0.76-0.78). Visualizes where structural fails most.\"\n      - \"Fig C: Confusion matrix heatmaps (2×2) for structural GB and probe on gold — structural shows massive FN block (gold=stag, pred=prog); probe shows more balanced errors.\"\n      - \"Fig D: Disagreement window analysis — stacked bars showing what fraction of each method's predictions align with gold vs MV on the 143 contested windows. Probe aligns more with gold; structural aligns more with MV.\"\n      - \"Fig E: Distribution of probe prediction probability on gold-validated vs gold-rejected FP windows — bimodal: probe is confident on gold-validated FPs (mean prob 0.91), less confident on truly-wrong FPs (mean prob 0.72).\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Gold set 结果确认 worst 档：structural dominance 是 circular evaluation artifact。\n\n      核心证据链：(1) MV 与 gold 仅 78% 一致——22% 窗口上 LF 标签错误，以漏标语义停滞为主；\n      (2) Structural 在 LF 标签上 0.995 暴跌到 gold 上 0.78-0.80，因为 structural 本质是\n      LF 逆向工程器——它学会了 \"cmd_rep high → stag, file_diff high → prog\" 这套规则，\n      但这套规则在 22% 窗口上是错的；(3) Probe 在 gold 上 0.82-0.84，超过 structural 2-4pp——\n      语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的信号；(4) Probe 之前的 FP (on LF) 中 42% 被 gold 验证\n      为正确——probe 的 \"错误模式\" 恰好是 gold 认为正确的模式；(5) LLM judge 在 gold 上提升，\n      进一步确认 LF 标签偏差而非方法本身的问题。\n\n      论文 reframe 方向：Claim 1 从 \"structural dominance\" 转为 \"circular evaluation as\n      systematic risk\"——30 个结构特征在 LF-derived labels 上 0.995 是问题的量化，不是成就。\n      Claim 2 变为 \"probe gold-robustness\"——embedding-based detectors 在噪声标签训练下\n      仍保留超越 LF 的信号。650-window benchmark 成为论文最重要的 resource contribution。\n\n      风险与对策：κ=0.76 偏低可能被 reviewer 质疑标注质量——需要展示 adjudication 流程 +\n      分歧案例分析证明 κ 低是因为任务内在模糊性，不是标注者不称职。Gold 样本 N=650 占\n      conf≥2 的 4.2%——reviewer 可能要求更大样本——对策是展示 3-seed 子采样稳定性\n      (std<0.01)。\n\n  - name: llm-judge-fewshot\n    plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n    description: >\n      LLM-as-judge with 5-shot examples (2 stagnation + 2 progress + 1 ambiguous boundary case)\n      + chain-of-thought prompting. Claude Sonnet 4. Evaluated on 650 gold windows.\n    expected_results:\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.81\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.75\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.87\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_precision_stag: 0.78\n      llm_judge_fewshot_gold_recall_stag: 0.72\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1_ref: 0.73\n      fewshot_vs_zeroshot_gold_delta_pp: +8.0\n      fewshot_vs_structural_gb_gold_delta_pp: +1.0\n      fewshot_vs_probe_qwen_gold_delta_pp: -1.0\n      fewshot_vs_probe_bge_gold_delta_pp: -3.0\n      api_cost_usd: 15.20\n      total_tokens: 4350000\n      mean_cot_length_tokens: 187\n      parse_failures: 2\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      Few-shot examples 教会 LLM \"语义停滞\" 的具体表现——agent 做了多样但无效的操作序列\n      ——这正是 gold 标注者捕捉但 LF 遗漏的模式。CoT 强迫 LLM 显式推理 \"这些操作是否\n      朝目标推进\"，将 stag recall 从 zero-shot 的 ~0.58 提升到 0.72。\n\n      0.81 的 gold F1 与 probe (0.82) 和 structural GB (0.80) 在统计上不可区分——三种\n      截然不同的方法在 gold 上收敛到相同水平。这是 worst 档的关键发现：structural 在\n      LF 标签上领先 LLM +33pp（0.995 vs 0.663），但在 gold 上反而落后 1pp（0.80 vs 0.81）\n      ——\"dominance\" 完全是 circular artifact。\n\n      Cost 从 $11.66 升到 $15.20（+30%），因为 5-shot examples + CoT chain 增加了 prompt\n      长度。但 LLM 的主要劣势不是 cost 而是 stag precision 偏低（0.78）——LLM 倾向于\n      将探索性行为误判为停滞（aggressive stagnation caller），few-shot examples 部分\n      缓解但未完全解决。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Judge Variants vs Other Methods on Gold (N=650)\"\n        columns: [Method, Gold_Macro_F1, Gold_F1_Stag, Gold_Recall_Stag, Cost_USD]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LLM 0-shot\", 0.73, 0.66, 0.58, 11.66]\n          - [\"LLM 5-shot+CoT\", 0.81, 0.75, 0.72, 15.20]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", 0.80, 0.71, 0.63, 0.00]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.82, 0.76, 0.71, 0.00]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.84, 0.78, 0.74, 0.00]\n\n      - name: \"Table: LF-Label vs Gold-Label Performance Spread\"\n        columns: [Method, LF_Macro_F1, Gold_Macro_F1, Δ_pp, Rank_on_LF, Rank_on_Gold]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural GB, 0.9951, 0.80, -19.5, 1, 4]\n          - [Structural RF, 0.9951, 0.78, -21.5, 1, 5]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.9413, 0.84, -10.1, 3, 1]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.9055, 0.82, -8.6, 4, 2]\n          - [\"LLM 5-shot+CoT\", \"~0.74†\", 0.81, \"+7.0†\", 5, 3]\n          - [\"LLM 0-shot\", 0.6625, 0.73, +6.8, 6, 6]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Rank reversal visualization — parallel coordinates plot showing method rankings on LF labels (left axis) vs gold labels (right axis). Structural drops from rank 1→4/5; probe rises from 3-4→1-2; LLM rises from 5-6→3.\"\n      - \"Fig: 2-3 CoT output examples where LLM correctly reasons about semantic stagnation — e.g., 'The agent modified 3 different files and ran unique commands, but each edit reverts or contradicts the previous one, indicating circular problem-solving without convergence.'\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      LLM few-shot 结果是 structural dominance claim 的致命打击。在 LF 标签上 structural\n      领先 LLM +33pp；在 gold 上 LLM few-shot 反超 structural +1pp。5 个 in-context\n      examples 高效传递了 \"语义停滞\" 概念——无需 30 个手工特征 + 训练分类器。\n\n      更深层的意义：三种完全不同的方法路线（hand-crafted features → ML classifier、\n      frozen embeddings → GRU probe、LLM in-context learning）在 gold 上收敛到 0.80-0.84\n      区间——这暗示 650 窗口标注集的 \"可达上界\" 约 0.84-0.86（受限于标注 ambiguity, κ=0.76）。\n      所有方法都在逼近人类标注者间一致性的天花板，而非某种方法有本质优势。\n\n      这支持论文 reframe 为 methodology paper：问题不是 \"哪种方法最好\" 而是\n      \"circular evaluation 如何系统性扭曲方法排序\"。\n\n  - name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n    description: >\n      从 30 维结构特征中移除与 LF 直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关: command_repetition_ratio,\n      unique_command_ratio, repeated_command_count 等; file_diff 相关: file_diff_count,\n      files_modified, diff_size 等），测量残差特征在 gold 上的 F1 以隔离非 circular 贡献。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Full structural on gold (reference) ---\n      full_30dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      full_30dim_lf_macro_f1: 0.9951\n\n      # --- Feature decomposition ---\n      overlap_features_removed_n: 12\n      overlap_feature_names: >\n        command_repetition_ratio, unique_command_ratio, repeated_command_count,\n        command_diversity_index, file_diff_count, files_modified, diff_line_count,\n        diff_size_bytes, new_files_created, file_diversity_ratio,\n        cmd_rep_binary, file_diff_binary\n      residual_features_n: 18\n\n      # --- Residual structural on gold ---\n      residual_gold_macro_f1: 0.70\n      residual_gold_f1_stag: 0.60\n      residual_gold_f1_prog: 0.80\n      residual_gold_accuracy: 0.74\n\n      # --- Residual structural on LF labels ---\n      residual_lf_macro_f1: 0.87\n      residual_lf_f1_stag: 0.82\n      residual_lf_f1_prog: 0.92\n\n      # --- Overlap-only features ---\n      overlap_only_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n      overlap_only_lf_macro_f1: 0.98\n\n      # --- Key deltas ---\n      overlap_ablation_delta_gold_pp: -10.0\n      overlap_ablation_delta_lf_pp: -12.5\n      residual_vs_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -12.0\n      residual_vs_probe_bge_gold_pp: -14.0\n      residual_vs_random_gold_pp: +20.0\n\n      # --- Top residual features by gold importance ---\n      top_residual_features:\n        - name: action_diversity_entropy\n          gini_importance: 0.18\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.62\n        - name: trajectory_position_normalized\n          gini_importance: 0.14\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.59\n        - name: mean_output_length\n          gini_importance: 0.12\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.57\n        - name: step_duration_variance\n          gini_importance: 0.09\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.56\n        - name: action_length_mean\n          gini_importance: 0.08\n          gold_univariate_f1: 0.55\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除 12 个与 LF 计算直接重叠的特征剥离了 circular signal 通路。这 12 个特征本质上是\n      LF 输入的子集或高度相关变量——cmd_rep LF 直接使用 command_repetition_ratio，\n      file_diff LF 直接使用 file_diff_count。当 evaluation labels 也由这些 LF 生成时，\n      这些特征天然具有近完美预测力，但这是 tautological 的。\n\n      残差 18 个特征（action diversity entropy、trajectory position、output length 特征等）\n      在 gold 上仅 0.70——比 full structural 低 10pp，比 probe 低 12pp。这证实：\n      structural 在 gold 上的 0.80 中，约 10pp（~55%的有效 signal）来自 LF-overlap 特征\n      的 circular 贡献。\n\n      残差 0.70 仍高于 random (0.50) 20pp——非 overlap 特征确实捕获了一些真实停滞信号。\n      Action diversity entropy 是最强残差特征（gini=0.18）：停滞窗口的动作多样性确实偏低，\n      这不完全等同于 cmd_rep（低多样性 ≠ 高重复）。Trajectory position 也有信号：停滞更多\n      发生在中后段。但这些信号远不足以与 probe 的语义表征竞争。\n\n      Overlap-only 特征在 gold 上 0.77——高于残差（0.70），因为 cmd_rep 和 file_diff 确实\n      捕获了真实的停滞信号（重复和无文件变更是停滞的真实指标）。问题不是这些特征无信息量，\n      而是在 LF-derived labels 上评估它们将 0.77 的真实能力膨胀为 0.98。\n\n      在 LF 标签上，残差仍达 0.87（vs 0.995 full），因为即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出\n      间接相关（如 action_diversity 与 cmd_rep 相关 r≈0.6）——这进一步说明 LF-label\n      evaluation 的 circularity 不仅限于直接 overlap 特征。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Overlap Ablation — LF vs Gold Performance (N=650)\"\n        columns: [Feature_Set, N_Feat, LF_Macro_F1, Gold_Macro_F1, LF-Gold_Gap]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full structural\", 30, 0.9951, 0.80, 0.195]\n          - [\"Residual (non-overlap)\", 18, 0.87, 0.70, 0.17]\n          - [\"Overlap-only\", 12, 0.98, 0.77, 0.21]\n          - [\"Probe Qwen (ref)\", \"—\", 0.9055, 0.82, 0.086]\n          - [\"Probe BGE (ref)\", \"—\", 0.9413, 0.84, 0.101]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Signal Decomposition on Gold\"\n        columns: [Component, Gold_Macro_F1, Contribution_to_Full, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full structural\", 0.80, \"100%\", \"Total structural signal on gold\"]\n          - [\"Overlap features (circular)\", 0.77, \"~55%†\", \"Circular + genuine mixed signal\"]\n          - [\"Residual features\", 0.70, \"~45%†\", \"Genuine non-circular signal only\"]\n          - [\"†Note: non-additive decomposition, percentages are approximate via Shapley-style attribution\", \"\", \"\", \"\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Top-5 Residual Features (Gold-Label Importance)\"\n        columns: [Feature, Gini, Gold_Univariate_F1, Correlation_w_cmd_rep]\n        rows:\n          - [action_diversity_entropy, 0.18, 0.62, 0.61]\n          - [trajectory_position_norm, 0.14, 0.59, 0.08]\n          - [mean_output_length, 0.12, 0.57, 0.23]\n          - [step_duration_variance, 0.09, 0.56, 0.15]\n          - [action_length_mean, 0.08, 0.55, 0.31]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Stacked bar — structural F1 decomposed into overlap contribution (blue) and residual contribution (orange) on LF labels vs gold labels. On LF labels the blue bar dominates (0.98 vs 0.87); on gold both shrink but blue shrinks more (0.77 vs 0.70). Visualizes circularity tax.\"\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance comparison heatmap — 30 features × 2 evaluation regimes (LF importance vs gold importance). LF-overlap features show massive importance drop from LF→gold; residual features show modest but stable importance across both.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter — each structural feature's LF-label importance (x) vs gold-label importance (y). Points above y=x are 'genuinely important'; points far below are 'circularly inflated'. Overlap features cluster below y=x; most residual features near y=x.\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Overlap ablation 是 circular evaluation 的 smoking gun。核心发现：移除 12 个与 LF\n      直接重叠的特征后，structural 在 gold 上从 0.80 跌至 0.70——10pp 的 circular premium。\n      而 probe 在 gold 上 0.82，领先残差 structural 12pp。\n\n      这意味着：如果用一个 \"公平\" 的（non-circular）structural baseline，probe 始终更优。\n      Structural 的 \"优势\" 完全建立在 evaluation circularity 上。\n\n      残差 0.70 > random 0.50 证明 structural 不是完全无用——action diversity、trajectory\n      position 等特征确实有信号。但 0.70 的水平显著低于 probe（0.82-0.84），说明这些\n      hand-crafted 特征远不如 learned semantic representations 有效。\n\n      论文呈现策略：将 overlap ablation 作为 \"circular evaluation 量化\" 的核心实验。\n      配合 gold validation 结果，构建完整的 evidence chain：LF labels 上 structural 0.995\n      是问题（circular），不是成就（signal）。残差 F1 0.70 是 structural 的 \"真实能力\"，\n      0.995 - 0.70 = 29.5pp 是 circular inflation。但需注意 LF 标签上残差 0.87 也受间接\n      circularity 影响——即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出有相关性。\n\n  - name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n    description: >\n      对 cross-agent structural GB 执行严格的 instance-level 测试隔离——确保 SWE-agent\n      训练集中的 SWE-bench task instance 不出现在 OH 评估集中。消除任务级信息泄漏。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Original results (reference) ---\n      original_gb_cross_all_macro_f1: 0.9674\n      original_gb_cross_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9919\n\n      # --- Instance isolation ---\n      shared_instances_n: 847\n      shared_instances_pct: 28.3\n      shared_instance_windows: 42600\n      non_shared_eval_windows: 108052\n      non_shared_eval_stag_rate: 0.228\n\n      # --- Isolated structural GB ---\n      isolated_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n      isolated_gb_f1_stag: 0.84\n      isolated_gb_f1_prog: 0.94\n      isolated_gb_accuracy: 0.91\n      isolation_delta_pp: -7.7\n\n      # --- Isolated structural RF ---\n      isolated_rf_macro_f1: 0.86\n      isolated_rf_f1_stag: 0.80\n      isolated_rf_f1_prog: 0.92\n\n      # --- Isolated probe comparisons ---\n      probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.58\n      probe_5pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.84\n      probe_10pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.91\n      probe_20pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.94\n      probe_50pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.96\n\n      # --- Gap analysis ---\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_zs_isolated_pp: +31.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_5ft_isolated_pp: +5.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_10ft_isolated_pp: -2.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_20ft_isolated_pp: -5.0\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_50ft_isolated_pp: -7.0\n      crossover_point_shifts_from: \"50% FT\"\n      crossover_point_shifts_to: \"~8% FT\"\n\n      # --- Shared vs non-shared difficulty ---\n      shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.42\n      non_shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.28\n      shared_easier: true\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      约 28% 的 OH 评估窗口来自与 SWE-agent 训练集共享的 SWE-bench task instance。\n      这些共享任务上，structural features（command patterns、file modification patterns）\n      天然相似——同一个 bug 触发相似的 debugging 命令序列和文件修改，无论用哪个 agent。\n      因此 structural classifier 在共享任务上的表现被 task-level similarity 而非\n      agent-invariant stagnation patterns 所支撑。\n\n      移除共享实例后，GB 从 0.967 降到 0.89（-7.7pp）。降幅显著但 0.89 仍然 substantial\n      ——structural 确实有跨 agent 的迁移能力，只是被高估了。非共享任务更难（平均 solve rate\n      28% vs 42%），难任务上 stagnation patterns 更 diverse、更 agent-specific，导致\n      structural 特征的迁移效果减弱。\n\n      关键变化在 probe comparison：原始数据中 probe 50% FT 才追平 structural（0.968 ≈ 0.967），\n      isolation 后 probe 10% FT 就超过 structural（0.91 > 0.89, +2pp）。Crossover point\n      从 50% 前移到 ~8%——probe 的语义表征对 task-level variation 更 robust（embedding\n      编码语义而非表面命令模式）。Probe zero-shot 基本不受影响（0.598→0.58, -1.8pp），\n      因为 zero-shot 的瓶颈是 domain shift 而非 task overlap。\n\n      共享实例更容易（solve rate 更高）也意味着原始评估高估了所有方法的 cross-agent 性能，\n      但 structural 受影响更大——structural 的 task-specific pattern matching 在简单任务\n      上更有效。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instance Isolation Impact on Cross-Agent Transfer\"\n        columns: [Method, Original_All, Isolated, Δ_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural GB, 0.9674, 0.89, -7.7]\n          - [Structural RF, 0.9123, 0.86, -5.2]\n          - [\"Probe 0-shot\", 0.5984, 0.58, -1.8]\n          - [\"Probe 5% FT\", 0.8503, 0.84, -1.0]\n          - [\"Probe 10% FT\", 0.9179, 0.91, -0.8]\n          - [\"Probe 20% FT\", 0.9475, 0.94, -0.8]\n          - [\"Probe 50% FT\", 0.9682, 0.96, -0.8]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Structural vs Probe Crossover Under Instance Isolation\"\n        columns: [Comparison, Original_Gap_pp, Isolated_Gap_pp, Shift]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 0-shot\", +36.9, +31.0, \"narrowed 5.9pp\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 5% FT\", +11.7, +5.0, \"narrowed 6.7pp\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 10% FT\", +5.0, -2.0, \"REVERSED\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 20% FT\", +2.0, -5.0, \"reversed, probe widens\"]\n          - [\"GB vs Probe 50% FT\", -0.1, -7.0, \"probe advantage widens\"]\n\n      - name: \"Table: Shared vs Non-Shared Instance Characteristics\"\n        columns: [Subset, N_Instances, N_Windows, Mean_Solve_Rate, Stag_Rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Shared, 847, 42600, 0.42, 0.19]\n          - [Non-shared, 2547, 108052, 0.28, 0.23]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Line plot — cross-agent macro_f1 vs probe FT fraction (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, 50%), two lines: original (dashed) and instance-isolated (solid). Structural GB shown as horizontal lines. Crossover moves from ~50% to ~8% under isolation.\"\n      - \"Fig: Box plot — structural GB per-instance F1 distribution, shared (left) vs non-shared (right). Non-shared has wider spread and lower median, showing task-level similarity inflates cross-agent numbers.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter — per-instance task difficulty (solve rate, x-axis) vs structural GB instance-level F1 (y-axis). Positive correlation confirms structural features transfer better on easier/more-common bug types.\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      Instance isolation 削弱了 structural cross-agent 的另一面优势。原始叙事：\"structural\n      0.967, probe 需要 50% FT 才追平\"。Isolated 叙事：\"structural 0.89, probe 10% FT\n      (0.91) 已超过\"。Crossover point 从 50% 前移到 ~8%——实际部署中只需几十个标注窗口\n      就够让 probe 超越 structural。\n\n      这对论文意味着：(1) Structural 的零数据优势仍然存在且 substantial（+31pp over probe\n      0-shot），但 \"0.967\" 的数字被 task overlap 高估了 7.7pp；(2) \"有少量数据时方法收敛\"\n      的结论被强化——不再是 \"50% 才追平\" 而是 \"10% 就反超\"；(3) Structural 的 practical\n      value proposition 进一步缩窄——只在严格零数据场景是最优选择，且真实 cross-agent\n      性能是 0.89 而非 0.967。\n\n      结合 gold-set 结果（in-domain 上 probe 已超过 structural）和 overlap ablation\n      （structural 优势 55%+ 来自 circular features），三个实验合力构成完整证据：\n      structural dominance 是 circular evaluation + task overlap + LF-derived metrics\n      三重 artifact 的产物。真实世界中 probe 是更好的选择——只要有 ≥10% 目标域数据或\n      gold-standard evaluation。\n\n      论文最终 practical recommendation：\n      - 零数据部署 → structural（0.89 isolated, 仍远超 probe 0-shot 的 0.58）\n      - ≥10% 目标数据 → probe（0.91+, 超过 structural 且持续改善）\n      - 评估 → 必须有 gold set（LF-derived metrics 高估 structural 19-21pp）\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"571e997d-8e82-4fe1-abf0-20ec50bbca3b","total_cost_usd":0.8833205,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38716,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":24066,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38716,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":24066,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38716,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38716},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":33685,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.033764999999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":24066,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":38716,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8495554999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":